0 1 46 15 0 3 De-Tuned Filter Frequency Response
.TXT 25 -5 16168 0
Cg a59.875000,66.000000,154
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
